Subject: Add quake-rerelease, the 2021 re-release, and GOG's Quake Enhanced
 installer

Nightdive's 2021 re-release of Quake ships an id1/pak0.pak of its own
(180815252 bytes, md5 4cb29cb699d34510da6c465bbe54fa81): the 1.06 pak0
and pak1 together with a new progs.dat, coloured lighting and md5
models. Its QuakeC prints its strings from localization/loc_english.txt,
which gdp already takes out of QuakeEX.kpf. QuakeSpasm 0.94 and later
play it from a base directory of its own; the classic engines do not,
so it can't take the place of quake-registered's files.

quake-rerelease installs the pak and the strings into
$assets/quake-rerelease. The re-release's music is byte for byte the
Ogg Vorbis rip gdp already knows (quake_campaign_soundtrack.zip's
files); they are optional files of the package, in its own id1/music,
because quake-music is an expansion of quake-registered and gdp does
not make it from a re-release alone.

GOG's setup_quake_enhanced_1.0_(60828).exe (607645056 bytes) is
unpacked with innoextract for the re-release's pak, QuakeEX.kpf, the
music and Dimension of the Machine (mg1/pak0.pak, which gdp knows). Its
hipnotic, rogue and dopa paks are re-release builds gdp does not know.

Forwarded: not yet (candidate for Debian)

diff --git a/data/quake.yaml b/data/quake.yaml
--- a/data/quake.yaml
+++ b/data/quake.yaml
@@ -183,6 +183,25 @@ packages:
     symlinks:
       $install_to/mg1/tryexec: $bindir/quake
 
+  quake-rerelease:
+    # Nightdive's 2021 re-release ("Quake Enhanced" on GOG): an id1/pak0.pak of
+    # its own (the 1.06 pak0 and pak1 together, a new progs.dat, coloured
+    # lighting, md5 models) whose QuakeC prints its strings from
+    # localization/loc_english.txt in QuakeEX.kpf. QuakeSpasm 0.94 and later
+    # play it from a base directory of its own (-basedir); the classic engines
+    # do not. Its CD music is the Ogg Vorbis rip quake-music knows
+    # (quake_campaign_soundtrack.zip's files, byte for byte), installed here
+    # too when present: quake-music, an expansion of quake-registered, is not
+    # made without that package.
+    aliases: [rerelease, enhanced]
+    longname: "Quake (2021 re-release)"
+    copyright: "\u00a9 1996-2021 id Software"
+    install:
+    - id1/pak0.pak?rerelease
+    - localization/loc_english.txt
+    optional:
+    - contents of quake_campaign_soundtrack.zip
+
   quake-music:
     copyright: "\u00a9 1996 id Software"
     aliases: [music]
@@ -291,6 +310,10 @@ files:
     look_for:
     - pak0.pak
 
+  id1/pak0.pak?rerelease:
+    look_for:
+    - pak0.pak
+
   manual.txt?101_cd:
     distinctive_name: false
 
@@ -507,6 +530,19 @@ files:
     provides:
       - localization/loc_english.txt
 
+  # GOG.com's Quake Enhanced installer (the 2021 re-release, build 60828):
